  "details": "When typing Japanese in the VRChat chat input field on desktop, the Japanese IME's predictive conversion suggestions overlap the chat input area, making it difficult to see what I am typing.\n\nAs shown in the attached screenshot, the predictive text window appears directly over the chat input field. This makes typing Japanese very uncomfortable and difficult to use.\n\nExpected Behavior:\n\nThe predictive text window should be positioned somewhere that does not overlap the chat input field, or the chat interface should be adjusted to prevent this issue.\n\nActual Behavior:\n\nThe predictive text suggestions overlap the chat input field, making the text difficult to read while typing.\n\nPlatform: PC / Windows\n\nLanguage: Japanese",
